dio/zipball/v0.1.2","body":"## Downloads\n\n| Platform | File |\n| --- | --- |\n| macOS (Apple Silicon) | `Guide-Studio-macOS-arm64-*.dmg` |\n| macOS (Intel) | `Guide-Studio-macOS-x64-*.dmg` |\n| Windows | `*.exe` |\n| Linux | `*.AppImage`, `*.deb`, `*.pacman` |\n\n`SHA256SUMS.txt` lists the checksum for every file.\n\n### These builds are unsigned\n\nThere is no Apple Developer ID or Windows code-signing certificate\nbehind this project, so the OS will warn you on first launch.\n\n**macOS** — after dragging the app to `/Applications`:\n\n```bash\nxattr -rd com.apple.quarantine \"/Applications/Guide Studio.app\"\n```\n\nThen grant **Screen Recording** and **Accessibility** in\nSystem Settings → Privacy & Security.\n\n**Windows** — SmartScreen shows \"Windows protected your PC\".\nChoose **More info → Run anyway**.\n\n**Linux** — if the AppImage fails with a sandbox error, run it with\n`--no-sandbox`.\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/3gensolution/Guide-Studio/commits/v0.1.2"}]